# Dependencies — never bake node_modules into the image
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts — rebuilt inside Docker
**/dist
**/.next

# Secrets — must NEVER end up in an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/set-aws-creds*

# Git / tooling noise
.git
.claude
.agents
**/*.log
**/*.md
!README.md

# Frontend and infra are not needed for the backend image
nextjs/
infra/
